{"product_id":"unnamable-presen","title":"Unnamable Present","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe ninth part of Roberto Calasso’s masterwork, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Unnamable Present\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, is closely connected with themes of the first book, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Ruin of Kasch\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (originally published in 1983, and reissued by FSG in a new translation). But while \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eKasch\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is an enlightened exploration of modernity, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Unnamable Present\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e propels us into the twenty first century.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTourists, terrorists, secularists, fundamentalists, hackers, transhumanists, algorithmicians: these are all tribes that inhabit the unnamable present and act on its nervous system. This is a world that seems to have no living past, but was foreshadowed in the period between 1933 and 1945, when everything appeared bent on self-annihilation. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Unnamable Present\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a meditation on the obscure and ubiquitous process of transformation happening today in all societies, which makes so many previous names either inadequate or misleading or a parody of what they used to mean.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTranslated with sensitivity by Calasso’s longtime translator, Richard Dixon, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Unnamable Present\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a strikingly original and provocative vision of our times, from the writer \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eThe Paris Review\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e called “a literary institution of one.”\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Grant Design Collaborative\u003cbr\u003eISBN:9780141988016\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 193\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 226 x 231\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44478070685849,"sku":"17RA-2-9780141988016","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/UnnamablePresent.jpg?v=1718208192","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/unnamable-presen","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}